# A LAN session in the windowed app on Metal, the Mac hosting
# (tools/lan/mac_session.py run host --app): Escape through the intro movies,
# the main menu, Multiplayer -> Other Multiplayer -> Host Game "mac-ref" ->
# the room, then the steps appended to the live file (@LIVE@ is replaced by its
# path), one at a time as they arrive. The menus and the lobby are 1024x768
# whatever the window's size; the coordinates are host.script's.
timeout 7200000
pointer f32 [0x9197a8]+4 [0x9197a8]+8
hold 250
wait frames 30
key ESCAPE
wait 2500
key ESCAPE
wait 2500
key ESCAPE
wait size 1024 768 within 180000
wait 3000
moveby 1 1
wait 300
dump main-menu

click 511 371                 # Multiplayer
wait change within 30000
wait 2000
dump won

pointer system
click 618 644                 # Other Multiplayer
wait change within 20000
wait 2000
dump lan

click 774 662                 # Host Game
wait change 0.01 within 20000
wait 1000
click 554 306                 # the Game Name field
wait 500
type mac-ref
wait 500
dump host-dialog
click 448 480                 # Create Game
wait change 0.05 within 20000
wait 3000
dump room                     # Game: mac-ref; the advert goes out on UDP 8585
log hosting mac-ref; following the live file
follow @LIVE@
